  "answer_text": "It looks like you're trying to access the **FedEx Express** website. The correct and active URL for FedEx is **[www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com)**. Here's a summary of what FedEx.com offers:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\ude9a FedEx.com \u2013 Key Features & Services\n\n**General**\nYou can use FedEx.com to log in to your FedEx account, get your tracking status, find a FedEx location near you, learn more about how to become a better shipper, get online print offers, or get inspiration for your small business needs.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83d\udce6 Package Tracking**\nYou can enter your FedEx tracking number, track by reference, obtain proof of delivery, or TCN. FedEx supports tracking for Express, Ground, Freight, and Custom Critical services.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83c\udfe0 FedEx Home Delivery**\nUse **FedEx Home Delivery** to ship to someone's house or apartment, or use **FedEx Ground** to ship to businesses.\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers packages **150 lbs. or less** to residences **every day of the week**, with a **$5.95 residential surcharge** applied per package.\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers within **1\u20135 days**, every day of the week, including Saturday and Sunday (excluding Hawaii and Alaska).\n\n---\n\n**\u2708\ufe0f FedEx Express (Expedited Shipping)**\nExpedited shipping is a fast method for sending priority shipments that must reach their destination by a specific deadline, accommodating a range of items from individual envelopes and packages to palletized freight.\nWhen next-day delivery won't cut it, consider **FedEx SameDay\u00ae**.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83c\udf0d International Shipping**\nFedEx allows you to expand your reach to **130+ countries and territories**. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83c\udf81 FedEx Rewards**\nWhen you join **FedEx Rewards**, the extras start immediately \u2014 you'll get a **$10 gift card** for your first eligible shipment. Open a FedEx account to get started.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd17 Useful Links\n- \ud83c\udf10 Main Site: [fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html)\n- \ud83d\udccd Track a Package: [fedex.com/tracking](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/tracking.html)\n- \ud83c\udfe0 Home Delivery Info: [fedex.com/home-delivery](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/shipping/home-delivery.html)\n- \u2708\ufe0f Express Shipping: [fedex.com/express](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/shipping/express.html)\n\nIs there something specific you'd like help with on FedEx, such as tracking a package or learning about shipping options?",
